# ─── STM32CubeIDE build output ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# Regenerated by Project > Build. Never commit these: a rebuild rewrites every
# .o and .map, which turns a two-line firmware PR into a 583-file diff.
Debug/
Release/
*.elf
*.bin
*.hex
*.map
*.list
*.o
*.d
*.su
*.cyclo

# ─── Eclipse workspace state ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Per-machine. Contains indexes, build logs and window layout — not source.
.metadata/
*.launch
RemoteSystemsTempFiles/
.recommenders/

# ─── Node ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnp.*

# Build output of the React app
gui/guad-gui/build/
gui/guad-gui/.eslintcache

# ─── Secrets ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Only *.example files belong in git. A real .env holds the Mongo Atlas URI.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
!.env.example
!.env.docker.example

# ─── OS / editor cruft ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
